WEBVTT

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:20.040
Rental Magica

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:02.610
It's far too early for you to be leaving,
isn't it, Adelicia Lenn Mathers?

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:07.250
After you came all this way to my studio,
I can't let you leave without a souvenir.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.720
I wish to show you the very best care.

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:13.420
Oh, you'll just be wasting your time.

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:17.290
I didn't know you'd established a studio here.

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:21.890
Judaix Tholoide, greatest pupil of Tsukasa Iba.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:28.000
Ah. And here I thought my
master's name was fading away.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:35.410
But then, four months ago... 3241 hours
and 36 minutes ago, to be precise,

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:41.780
you were involved in that Magi Night incident
with Astral's successor, were you not?

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.390
So, that's what you're after!

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.760
What do you want with Itsuki?!

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:52.460
Was it for his sake that the leader of
Goetia herself infiltrated my studio?

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.870
Come forth, Glasya-Labolas!
The bold earl who controls 36 legions!

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:09.670
Glasya-Labolas!

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:24.030
If that was your trump card,

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:26.800
it was somewhat lacking,
youngest child of Solomon.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.500
Do you have any other cards left to play?

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:34.070
You see your position is hopeless? How wise.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:38.100
However, daughter of Solomon,
it has now arrived.

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:42.170
Come forth, Forneus!
The marquis who rules 29 legions!

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.600
That eye!

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.810
Maybe I was a little careless.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.910
Honami will laugh at me...

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:16.510
Come forth, Eligor!
The mighty knight who leads 60 legions!

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.970
So, the witch of Solomon does not die easily.

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:45.770
Big Brother...

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:50.150
We need to obtain another basilisk eye.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.120
We leave for Japan at once.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:00.580
Episode 9
FATHER'S SUCCESSOR

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:08.030
Bills, bills, and more bills.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.790
Huh? This one's from Paris.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:12.360
From Adelicia?

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.340
Mr. Successor, you haven't
been keeping in touch.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:25.510
So, what's this inheritance from my
father that you were entrusted with?

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:30.990
The Association has determined that this
is a good time to turn it over to you,

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:34.930
now that you've been running
the company for six months.

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:38.720
You're saying the first six months
were his trial period, then?

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:40.460
So, what's in it?

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.870
We weren't authorized to know that.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:47.430
The Association was merely tasked with
delivering it unharmed to the successor.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.910
Control breeds resentment.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:53.170
The Association knows that, doesn't it?

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.540
May I look inside?

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.620
There's one problem with that.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:03.920
Someone has shown up to raise an
objection to your inheriting this.

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:11.630
To be blunt, they say you lack the
competence to be the company president...

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:13.690
...and are claiming the right of succession.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:15.790
W-What did you say?!

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:18.800
The Association isn't used
to this happening, either.

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:28.150
Look! An airship!

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:32.950
We've prepared a place for
you both to talk directly.

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:42.090
There's a weight limit, so we can only
allow you to take one witness with you.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:47.630
One thing's bothering me.

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:48.960
What?

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.770
I got this from Adelicia this morning.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:53.800
May I?

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.050
"I knew The Association was bureaucratic,"

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:02.280
"but it's nothing but paperwork, paperwork,
paperwork, paperwork, and more paperwork."

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:03.810
No, read farther down.

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:09.320
"Since The Association's branch office has
been giving me the runaround, I'm in Paris now."

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:13.490
"And I heard a name mentioned
there that's related to you."

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:17.790
"I've been doing a little checking
into this case on my own."

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:24.100
"If The Association contacts you about an
inheritance, don't do anything rash."

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:25.940
Checking into this?

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:29.040
This way.

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:35.080
Lapis! What are you doing here?!

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:37.880
Then you're saying she's the one who objected?

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:39.110
Yes.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:42.560
Lapis has brought her big brother's words to you.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:45.590
Right on time.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:51.720
I'm pleased to make your acquaintance.
My name is Judaix Tholoide.

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:53.630
What's?

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:57.000
Lapis is Judaix's agathion.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:59.070
It's the equivalent of a shikigami in Onmyoudou...

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:02.010
...or the 72 demons in Solomon's magic.

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:05.850
At the time of Astral's founding,
as a board member,

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:09.650
I received 20% control of the
company from Tsukasa Iba.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:11.150
From Father?

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:14.290
Even if you do hold partial
control of the company,

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:18.020
what right do you have now to question
our president's competence?

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:22.720
Because I am the one to
continue Tsukasa Iba's work.

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:26.800
Even though when Tsukasa Iba's
management right was up in the air,

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:30.330
The Association decided to give succession
preference to his next of kin?

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:35.770
Essentially. However, do you want to accept it?

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:41.910
It's true that you've somehow managed to
lead Astral for these last six months.

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:44.290
But there's something else I'd
like to ask you about that.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:48.720
Do you wish to continue living this life of a mage?

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:50.280
Me?

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:51.550
That's a low blow!

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.830
You think our president's a novice...

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:55.560
...and that you can manipulate
him with your words?!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.700
It's merely a question.

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:03.830
Six months ago, the situation demanded
that Itsuki Iba become Astral's president.

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:11.640
All I'm saying is that I can carry the burden
that was forced upon you in your place.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:14.500
You have no reason to take on that burden!

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:19.950
Astral's creation, development,
and downfall... I saw all of it.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:22.150
Right at Tsukasa Iba's side.

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:28.130
That is why I wish to inherit everything
that was his, including Astral.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.660
Everything...

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:36.100
I touched him, longed to be him,
spent my time trying to carry on his work.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:39.930
For so long. So very, very long...

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:45.510
I mean... No matter how you look at it,
we're just a small company.

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:47.710
Has the company president
in you awakened a bit?

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.740
Get back to the others...

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:50.880
I can't!

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:52.080
Forget me! Now hurry!

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:56.690
So, I kinda got stuck being his successor.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:00.620
Even so...

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.620
Even so, I'm Astral's president!

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:08.740
Honami, Mikan, Kuroha and Nekoyashiki...

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.640
...are my employees and I value them!

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:13.400
I can't simply leave them in the
hands of someone I've just met!

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:15.100
Boss!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.210
Then I declare a fehde and
propose we settle the matter...

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:22.240
...of Astral's succession and the
inheritance with a sorcery duel.

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:25.750
Duel?! I have no intention of fighting you!

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:30.350
Then neither of us will get this inheritance.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.420
Then it's this attache case that you're after?

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:36.660
Are you saying you'd be willing to
relinquish your claim on this inheritance?

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:42.860
Or perhaps Adelicia told you to stay away from it.

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:45.300
How do you know about her?

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:47.700
She was magnificent.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:51.680
A mage endowed with all that a mage should be,

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:53.840
and yet she wasn't consumed by it.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:58.680
Agree to the fehde and I will tell you
about the princess of Solomon.

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:01.810
Don't let him provoke you.

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:04.020
I have the agreement here.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.160
This was your plan from the start.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:13.030
I thought we could settle things
without having to use this.

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:18.310
Boss!

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:35.820
Then I will turn this attache
case over to you, Mr. Itsuki Iba.

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:36.520
Huh?

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:43.190
As of now, three magical battles are permitted
between Judaix Tholoide and Astral personnel.

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:45.330
When the battle is over,

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:49.340
if Mr. Judaix has managed to steal it, he wins.

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:52.200
If not, Mr. Iba wins.

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:54.530
I will present the winner with this key.

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:59.870
In short, the attache case itself
is now the object to be won.

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:03.570
The agreement is made.
The fehde is now on.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:05.350
No one can interfere.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.110
I approve.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:08.510
Very well.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.990
H-Hold it! What about Adelicia?!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.460
Where is she?

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:15.490
She's dead.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:20.230
She was killed as punishment for
sneaking into my studio.

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:24.570
Call it the inevitable conclusion
of a clash between two mages.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:29.640
Hold it.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.870
We're engaged in a fehde now.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:36.080
Even if I attack your familiar,
nobody will say anything about it.

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:37.840
I see.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:42.750
As you'll be my apprentice anyway,
I need to see your skill.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:47.090
I'm going to take revenge for
what you did to Addie!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:51.360
With the divine protection of
the holy wood, I weave this curse.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:56.100
Guided by the wind and rock,
strike the taboo child to the northwest!

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:14.150
You're foolish to place too
much trust in your magic.

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:16.250
Thus I reveal your clumsiness to all.

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:20.430
Adelicia is dead? Because of me?

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:25.260
Killed while sneaking into Judaix's studio?

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:29.960
Not trusting in your magic
at all means you're no mage!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.010
I weave it again!

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:35.810
By the divine protection of the holy wood,
which belongs to neither heaven nor earth,

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:37.640
I attack my foe!

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.120
I attack a third time!

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:46.220
With the divine protection of
holy wood and stone circle,

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:49.090
I forge a mother's protection
and a sword of hatred!

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:57.060
Boss! Escape through the rear door!

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:58.290
Boss!

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.760
Honami, as your president, I order you.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.640
45 degrees right oblique,

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:05.760
3 degrees downward correction,
fire mistletoe arrows!

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:14.140
That mist also functions as a hallucinogen.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.010
That eye of yours...

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:19.550
I owe you this, Judaix.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.960
You'll pardon me if I don't accept it.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:24.120
I'm not so foolish as to go up against your eye.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:41.600
A potion of Raimundus Lullus?

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:42.840
After her!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:47.710
Accelerate! Right turn, 6 degrees!

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:52.720
Downward right, 6 degrees!

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:54.710
Cast a barrier! Maximum acceleration!

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:56.280
Impossible...

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:03.130
Honami, maximum deceleration
to the rear! Nose up 270 degrees!

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:10.870
Judaix!

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:19.180
Icchan!

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.320
He directly severed the path?

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:37.290
However, you've now demonstrated
what I was most worried about.

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:39.460
Your Glam Sight...

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:51.800
Don't move.

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:56.680
Hail. By the divine protection of my
cone of power and the holy wood,

00:15:56.680 --> 00:16:00.810
distribute the life of the thousand-
year forest. Do my bidding.

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:07.190
Even if you are just provisionally the president,
what were you doing, taking a risk like that?

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:10.970
Granted, there are times it can't be helped,

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:15.900
but taking gambles like that when you don't
have to isn't what it means to be a leader.

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:19.540
Addie never would have done that...

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:22.170
I'm sorry, Honami.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:24.740
For involving Adelicia in this.

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:28.580
Besides, if that had gone on any longer,

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.880
I might have killed Lapis!

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:33.780
Promise me.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:39.720
Never take that eyepatch off
unless your life depends on it.

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:53.270
Got me?

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:56.570
Gotcha.

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:03.850
Big Sister Adelicia may not be dead at all.

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:06.980
That Judaix guy may have been lying.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:10.490
Mages die all the time.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:13.880
With what we do nowadays, it can't be helped.

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:18.790
Forcing yourself to control what can't
be controlled isn't what adults do.

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:22.840
Only a fool forces himself
to stand when he can't...

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:26.100
...and make a healable wound into one that isn't.

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:28.840
Up there!

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:38.650
Genbu! Suzaku! Seiryu! Byakko!

00:17:56.770 --> 00:17:57.790
Nekoyashiki!

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:01.710
I didn't dissipate the shock wave, did I?

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:06.910
How are the others?!

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:07.740
Boss!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:12.320
They're fine. It was projection magic
from outside. The mansion's screaming.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:14.780
Then Judaix's magic is...

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.020
I'll safeguard the inheritance.

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:18.880
Boss, see to the others!

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:20.090
Honami!

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:26.460
Wait, Honami!

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:34.040
What?

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:38.140
Lapis!

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:41.470
Yes, Big Brother. Lapis will do that.

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:46.120
You're talking to Judaix? Lapis, listen to me!

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:48.650
Lapis will end this here.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:57.660
First, let me say that I'm impressed.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.830
Seeing as how you're facing
me alone at a disadvantage,

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:01.660
shall I conclude you're a decoy?

00:19:01.770 --> 00:19:03.200
Imagine what you like.

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:06.470
Still, Astral, my old home, is impressive, isn't it?

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:10.570
It withstood the Lance of Thoth,
which I spent three years working on.

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:16.280
Or should I credit Nekoyashiki's skill for
strengthening the barrier at the last second?

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:20.450
Most importantly, because of that skill,
I need not fear him now.

00:19:20.520 --> 00:19:22.990
Enough of your rambling, Judaix.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:27.120
You were the mage we met in that
ley line mansion, weren't you?

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:30.050
Ah, so you remember.

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:32.230
How can I forget?

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.670
It was you who made Icchan's eyepatch.

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:38.270
Was it because you feel responsible?

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:43.410
Is that why you chose Astral,
a company teetering on the edge of closure,

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:46.680
when you had your pick of
the other magical groups?

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.710
You, the princess of Solomon...

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:52.810
What is it about that boy
which drives you to this?

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:55.850
The president's right eye
is definitely progressing.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:20:00.320
If you're the one who created it,
then you must know the cure.

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:02.990
I have no obligation to tell you.

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:07.330
You're not offering me the inheritance
in exchange for it, are you?

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:09.500
The only thing I'll exchange with you is this!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.870
Sing, our friend!

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:14.200
The descendant of the holy wood entreats you!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:18.110
Let the calamity within
thee be pierced by thy arm!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:30.110
Is this a specialty of Celtic magic?

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:33.420
Those wounds can't be
staunched by ordinary means.

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:37.360
I doubt you'd object to
trading your life for his.

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:40.030
Naturally, the fehde ends here, as well.

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:41.890
I do object.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.270
What?!

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:46.730
You're almost too perfect.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:55.510
You're an automaton?!

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:58.710
Nekoyashiki was the same as you.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:03.990
The ability to use 100% of your power
even in the worst of circumstances...

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:09.620
...simply means you will use 100%
of your power in any circumstances.

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:13.660
When your choices are limited,
it naturally becomes easy to plan.

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:17.170
I left Lapis and my elementals back there.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:20.510
More than enough to deal with an exhausted
Nekoyashiki, a novice priestess,

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:23.910
and your beloved president.

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:25.440
Icchan...

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:28.140
Holy W!

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:30.840
Too late.

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:07.810
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:16.220
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:29.270
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:41.190
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:47.460
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:51.960
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.830 --> 00:22:56.240
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:01.330
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:13.210
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:17.260
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:21.490
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:24.590
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.070
Fehde [MAGICAL DUEL]

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:30.600
Fehde [MAGICALDUEL]
A duel? Why do we have to do this?

00:23:30.600 --> 00:23:31.070
Fehde [MAGICALDUEL]
Because we can't come to a compromise.

00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:32.800
Because we can't come to a compromise.

00:23:32.870 --> 00:23:34.500
It's better than all-out war.

00:23:34.610 --> 00:23:36.340
But... But, I can't...

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:37.780
What do you think, Prof. Miwa?

